---

You can think of software as the “thoughts” or “commands” that control how the computer operates and what tasks it performs.

Just as there are many types of hardware, there are also different types of software, each serving a specific purpose.


<div style="width:100%; overflow-x:auto; margin:24px 0; font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color:#000000; box-sizing:border-box;">

  <div style="min-width:860px; max-width:1050px; margin:0 auto; padding:24px 28px 20px; border:2px solid #1F1976; border-radius:12px; background-color:#FFFFFF; box-sizing:border-box;">

  <!-- Main category -->
  <div style="display:flex; justify-content:center;">
      <div style="width:190px; padding:12px 16px; background-color:#6FCAFF; border:2px solid #06338D; border-radius:10px; text-align:center; font-size:20px; font-weight:700; line-height:1.2;">
        Computer Software
