  </div>

   <p style="margin:22px 8px 0; font-size:16px; line-height:1.35;">
          Helps users perform specific tasks.
        </p>

   </div>

   <!-- Utility Software -->
<div style="width:31%; text-align:center;">

   <div style="display:inline-block; min-width:150px; padding:10px 14px; background-color:#FBDAE8; border:2px solid #E62378; border-radius:8px; color:#921149; font-size:18px; font-weight:700; line-height:1.2; box-sizing:border-box;">
          Utility Software
        </div>

   <div aria-hidden="true" style="width:3px; height:14px; margin:0 auto; background-color:#E62378;"></div>
        <div aria-hidden="true" style="width:72%; height:3px; margin:0 auto; background-color:#E62378;"></div>

   <div style="display:flex; justify-content:center; gap:8px;">

   <div style="flex:1;">
            <div aria-hidden="true" style="width:3px; height:13px; margin:0 auto; background-color:#E62378;"></div>
            <div style="padding:10px 4px; background-color:#FFFFFF; border:2px solid #F07FB0; border-radius:20px; font-size:16px; font-weight:700;">
              Disk Utility
            </div>
          </div>

   <div style="flex:1;">
            <div aria-hidden="true" style="width:3px; height:13px; margin:0 auto; background-color:#E62378;"></div>
            <div style="padding:10px 4px; background-color:#FFFFFF; border:2px solid #F07FB0; border-radius:20px; font-size:16px; font-weight:700;">
              Bluetooth
            </div>
          </div>

  <div style="flex:1;">
            <div aria-hidden="true" style="width:3px; height:13px; margin:0 auto; background-color:#E62378;"></div>
            <div style="padding:10px 4px; background-color:#FFFFFF; border:2px solid #F07FB0; border-radius:20px; font-size:16px; font-weight:700;">
              Antivirus
            </div>
          </div>

  </div>

   <p style="margin:22px 8px 0; font-size:16px; line-height:1.35;">
          Maintains, optimizes, and secures the system.
        </p>

   </div>

  </div>

  </div>
</div>


<div style="background-color: #F7F7FB; border-left: 4px solid #4C42CF; border-radius: 8px; padding: 12px 16px;">
<p>📖 <b>System Software</b> manages the computer's hardware and basic operations. This includes the operating system (like Windows, macOS, ChromeOS, or Linux), which coordinates memory, processes, files, and devices so everything works together.</p>
</div>

<div style="background-color: #F7F7FB; border-left: 4px solid #4C42CF; border-radius: 8px; padding: 12px 16px; margin-top: 12px;">
<p>📖 <b>Application Software</b> helps users perform specific tasks. Examples include word processors, web browsers, games, design tools, and educational apps.</p>
</div>

<div style="background-color: #F7F7FB; border-left: 4px solid #4C42CF; border-radius: 8px; padding: 12px 16px; margin-top: 12px;">
<p>📖 <b>Utility Software</b> maintains, protects, and optimizes the computer system. Examples include antivirus programs, file compression tools, backup software, and disk cleanup utilities.</p>
</div>

